From 9ae54b8febc51ef95d2068ee34c130f42f354bb8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ritesh Pandit <87899750+Riteshp2001@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 06:53:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 090/140] fix: search keyboard auto-show, tab switching jitter,
 folder songs, seekbar light mode
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Search keyboard (#657): Add missing focusRequester import in
  MusicLibraryContent.kt to fix unresolved reference compile error.
- Tab switching (#654): Use instant scrollToPage for non-adjacent tab
  jumps to avoid jitter through intermediate pages.
- Folder songs (#642): Handle null DATA column on Android 10+ with
  content URI fallback in MusicLibraryScanner. Remove aggressive
  file.exists() checks in MediaFileRepository and VideoScanUtils since
  MediaStore entries are valid even when the direct file path is
  inaccessible.
- Seekbar visibility: Increase buffer/unplayed track alpha values in
  light mode (0.40→0.60, 0.24→0.38) for better contrast. Dark mode
  unchanged.

Fixes #654 #657 #642
